OL,3,GNEWSAPossible gang threat to family not
OL,4,Areviewed, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police safeguarding team did not
OL,7,Freview new intelligence about possible
OL,8,Fgang threats to a family before a fatal
OL,9,Farson attack because it did not work
OL,10,Fweekends at the time, an inquest has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FFour children died after their home in
OL,14,FWalkden, Salford, was firebombed on 11
OL,15,FDecember 2017. Their mother, Michelle
OL,16,FPearson, died of her injuries 20 months
OL,17,Flater, aged 37.
