OL,3,GNEWSAPossible gang threat to family not
OL,4,Areviewed, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Alison Barber said information
OL,7,Freceived by Greater Manchester Police
OL,8,F(GMP) on the Friday before the attack
OL,9,Fwould not have been seen until the
OL,10,FMonday, after the fire.
OL,12,FBarber told Bolton Coroners' Court
OL,13,Fpolice safeguards were in place and
OL,14,F"nothing much would have changed" if
OL,15,Fthe reports had been reviewed.
